    ├─ Log error
    ├─ Update signal status to "skipped"
    ├─ Send Telegram alert
    └─ Continue with next signal

Order Placement Error:
    ├─ Retry with fresh price (up to 3x)
    ├─ If still fails:
    │   ├─ Log error details
    │   ├─ Send Telegram alert
    │   └─ Mark signal as "failed"
    └─ Manual intervention required

Database Error:
    ├─ Close connection
    ├─ Log error
    ├─ Alert user
    └─ Attempt to reconnect on next cycle
```

